# VestCross frontend — copy to .env (never commit .env)
# When VITE_VESTCROSS_ADDRESS is set, the app reads live schedule state
# from QoreChain Diana through @qorechain/evm. Without it, the app runs
# in clearly-labelled local DEMO mode (in-memory simulation).
# VITE_VESTCROSS_ADDRESS=0xYourDeployedVestCrossAddress
# VITE_EVM_RPC_URL=https://evm-testnet.qore.host
